msgstr "建议与 Mihomo 原模式保持一致，改为手动选择（不再自动测速切换）。"

#: root/usr/share/hybrid-subscription/compatibility.rb
msgid "Use the target client latency testing; client timing and selection behavior may differ."
msgstr "建议改用目标客户端的延迟测速模式（测速触发时机与选路细节可能略有差异）。"

#: root/usr/share/hybrid-subscription/compatibility.rb
msgid "Ordered fallback keeps priority-based availability selection; native client behavior may still differ."
msgstr "建议改用故障转移模式，按候选顺序选择首个可用节点（不同客户端的健康检查细节可能略有差异）。"

#: root/usr/share/hybrid-subscription/compatibility.rb
msgid "This target has no native fallback mode; latency testing loses ordered failover priority."
msgstr "该客户端无原生故障转移模式；建议改用延迟测速模式（不再按固定先后顺序故障回退）。"

#: root/usr/share/hybrid-subscription/compatibility.rb
